                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Well, as of June 2026, what people have posted is still true, at least for me; This game cannot be finished. When you get to the last boss, the game gets stuck in a \"cut scene\" and will not allow you to continue. Nor open the menu or anything at that point. I have reset that level 3 times and it always gets stuck on the same point.\r\n\r\nYeah, the game before that is fun enough I suppose, but I still wouldn't recommend paying for it. Maybe if you could play it for free or get it for under 50 cents, you might get something out it's mindless simple fun? I mean, I listened to podcasts while playing, and it worked decently to shut my brain off to. But no, nt recommended.",
